{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52487","headline":"修西方十劝 十 · 道镜　善导","name":"修西方十劝 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劝君十，念佛常须心口急。\n思量业海苦轮深，生死忙忙悔难及。\n（以上二十二首均见《大正新修大藏经》第四十七册唐道镜、善导共集《念佛镜》。\n参《续藏经》本）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道镜　善导","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}